# Chuan hoa line ending LF cho toan bo file text, bat ke he dieu hanh checkout (Windows/Linux/
# macOS). Ly do: .php-cs-fixer.php yeu cau LF (khop noi dung da luu trong Git) va CI chay tren
# ubuntu-latest (Linux, giu nguyen LF khi checkout) - neu khong co file nay, may Windows co
# core.autocrlf=true se tu convert LF->CRLF luc checkout, khien `php-cs-fixer fix --dry-run`
# CHAY SACH tren Windows nhung FAIL tren CI Linux (dung y loi da xay ra tu CMS-057 den truoc
# lan sua nay - CI fail lien tuc ma khong ai phat hien vi chi lo ra tren Linux).
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
